WEBVTT

00:09.217 --> 00:12.387
<b>Brother… Father…</b>

00:12.477 --> 00:13.847
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

00:14.727 --> 00:17.187
<b>This is no place for a child.</b>

00:17.897 --> 00:20.527
<b>I was playing hide-and-seek and got lost.</b>

00:21.647 --> 00:24.697
<b>You certainly ran quite a long way.</b>

00:26.987 --> 00:30.787
<b>Your father's villa is far off
in that direction.</b>

00:32.997 --> 00:33.997
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:35.787 --> 00:39.837
<b>My name is Takauji Ashikaga,
a vassal from the Shimotsuke province.</b>

00:40.587 --> 00:43.007
<b>I heard there was quite a commotion
because Lord Takatoki,</b>

00:43.087 --> 00:45.177
<b>the regent,
had lost track of his precious son.</b>

00:45.837 --> 00:47.797
<b>And I somehow thought
you might be around here.</b>

00:49.177 --> 00:51.177
<b>"Somehow thought"?</b>

00:52.307 --> 00:54.977
<b>Come. Let us return to your family.</b>

00:56.977 --> 01:00.567
<b>No. They'll get angry and ban me
from playing hide-and-seek.</b>

01:00.647 --> 01:02.687
<b>I'd rather die than
not be able to run away anymore.</b>

01:02.777 --> 01:05.277
<b>Why are you so fixated on running away?</b>

01:09.067 --> 01:10.237
<b>Very well!</b>

01:10.327 --> 01:13.787
<b>Then, if you're forbidden
from playing hide-and-seek,</b>

01:13.867 --> 01:16.287
<b>I, Takauji,
shall secretly take on the role of "It"</b>

01:16.367 --> 01:17.917
<b>without your father knowing.</b>

01:18.537 --> 01:20.497
<b>I have good instincts.</b>

01:21.087 --> 01:23.627
<b>No matter where you run, I will find you.</b>

01:27.047 --> 01:28.387
<b>Really?</b>

01:28.467 --> 01:29.717
<b>Yes!</b>

01:30.387 --> 01:31.757
<b>Even to the depths of hell?</b>

01:32.307 --> 01:33.637
<b>What? Hell?</b>

01:33.717 --> 01:37.307
<b>My dream is to play a game of tag
with a real demon.</b>

01:37.387 --> 01:38.397
<b>Let's do it together!</b>

01:39.227 --> 01:41.897
<b>What a dangerous dream to have
at your age.</b>

01:42.477 --> 01:44.817
<b>Okay? Promise me!</b>

02:06.167 --> 02:11.507
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

03:19.497 --> 03:22.667
<b>KINMUNE SAIONJI'S RESIDENCE</b>

03:23.247 --> 03:27.047
<b>The day after tomorrow, two large banquets
will be held at the same time.</b>

03:28.547 --> 03:29.967
<b>One will be at Saionji's residence.</b>

03:30.627 --> 03:33.177
<b>A banquet where Mr. Yasuie
will assassinate the Emperor.</b>

03:34.387 --> 03:36.467
<b>The other will be at Kusunoki's residence.</b>

03:36.557 --> 03:39.637
<b>A banquet that
Takauji Ashikaga is certain to attend.</b>

03:40.847 --> 03:43.767
<b>We will assassinate Takauji
at the same time</b>

03:43.847 --> 03:45.857
<b>as Mr. Yasuie assassinates the Emperor.</b>

03:46.647 --> 03:48.107
<b>That is my plan.</b>

03:48.687 --> 03:50.487
<b>Even if both attempts fail,</b>

03:51.027 --> 03:54.027
<b>we can still cause devastating turmoil
within the current regime.</b>

03:54.107 --> 03:56.157
<b>I think it's worth trying.</b>

03:56.237 --> 03:59.747
<b>Killing Takauji, who leads the warriors,
would be more effective now</b>

03:59.827 --> 04:00.997
<b>than killing the Emperor.</b>

04:01.077 --> 04:05.207
<b>Father said that an assassination attempt
would not work against Takauji.</b>

04:05.877 --> 04:08.707
<b>We shouldn't take unnecessary risks.</b>

04:08.797 --> 04:12.837
<b>Yeah. I think getting the Young Lord
safely back to Shinano comes first.</b>

04:13.627 --> 04:15.337
<b>What about you, brat?</b>

04:15.427 --> 04:18.677
<b>Are you prepared to kill Takauji,
knowing the risks?</b>

04:22.307 --> 04:23.517
<b><i>If I can meet him,</i></b>

04:23.597 --> 04:25.977
<b><i>I have so many questions
I'd rather ask him than kill him.</i></b>

04:26.727 --> 04:29.437
<b><i>Why did he betray the Hojo?</i></b>

04:30.227 --> 04:32.527
<b><i>If I revealed that I'm still alive,</i></b>

04:33.237 --> 04:35.197
<b><i>how would he look at me?</i></b>

04:36.197 --> 04:37.197
<b><i>But…</i></b>

04:39.827 --> 04:41.537
<b>Let's take a chance and try it.</b>

04:41.617 --> 04:45.167
<b>Even if we fail, we've already scouted out
our escape routes.</b>

04:45.247 --> 04:46.917
<b>We'll split into two groups.</b>

04:46.997 --> 04:50.417
<b>Kojiro, Fubuki, and Genba,
you will attempt to assassinate Takauji.</b>

04:51.207 --> 04:53.917
<b>Shizuku and Ayako,
your job is to help my uncle escape.</b>

04:55.677 --> 04:59.177
<b>I'll go explain the escape route to Uncle.</b>

05:01.267 --> 05:04.057
<b>My attempt to assassinate the Emperor
will fail?</b>

05:04.137 --> 05:05.137
<b>FOR REAL?</b>

05:05.807 --> 05:08.227
<b>So Yorishige kept this from me.</b>

05:08.767 --> 05:11.187
<b>But Yorishige's foresight
is not always reliable.</b>

05:11.277 --> 05:12.277
<b>GIVE ME MY MONEY BACK</b>

05:12.357 --> 05:15.107
<b>I trusted him once before,
and paid dearly for it.</b>

05:15.897 --> 05:17.737
<b>LET'S DO THIS</b>

05:17.817 --> 05:20.117
<b>We won't know unless we try.</b>

05:20.197 --> 05:21.737
<b>I know.</b>

05:21.827 --> 05:24.867
<b>Once you make up your mind,
you never change it.</b>

05:25.657 --> 05:29.247
<b>But we have horses ready
for you and Sir Saionji.</b>

05:30.037 --> 05:34.717
<b>If it fails, please escape
under Shizuku and Ayako's guidance.</b>

05:35.587 --> 05:37.047
<b>Understood.</b>

05:39.007 --> 05:40.887
<b>And what will you do, Lord Tokiyuki?</b>

05:43.137 --> 05:45.807
<b>Something has come up that I cannot avoid.</b>

05:46.477 --> 05:47.937
<b>Don't worry.</b>

05:48.017 --> 05:51.187
<b>Once we are done,
let us meet at the designated place.</b>

05:52.147 --> 05:53.147
<b>Very well.</b>

06:00.617 --> 06:02.907
<b><i>I must prepare thoroughly…</i></b>

06:04.287 --> 06:06.657
<b><i>So that,
with at least something to show for it…</i></b>

06:08.167 --> 06:10.287
<b><i>We can all escape back to Shinano.</i></b>

06:12.287 --> 06:14.417
<b>DAY OF THE OPERATION (4 P.M.)</b>

06:22.137 --> 06:25.177
<b><i>Something is going to happen
in this capital today.</i></b>

06:25.267 --> 06:26.517
<b><i>I have a feeling it will.</i></b>

06:27.887 --> 06:31.437
<b><i>Boy… He's not like those
who only imitate the look of Basara.</i></b>

06:32.107 --> 06:35.607
<b><i>He's a country bumpkin,
but there's something hidden within him.</i></b>

06:50.617 --> 06:52.167
<b><i>But why?</i></b>

06:53.037 --> 06:55.047
<b><i>What's this ominous feeling?</i></b>

06:57.007 --> 06:59.167
<b>IMPERIAL GUARD STATION (6 P.M.)</b>

06:59.257 --> 07:00.797
<b>Well then, Mr. Yoshisada.</b>

07:01.387 --> 07:04.927
<b>With security so poor,
please be especially wary of assassins.</b>

07:05.007 --> 07:07.557
<b>You jest, Mr. Takauji.</b>

07:07.637 --> 07:11.517
<b>There is no one bold enough
to kill Yoshisada Nitta!</b>

07:13.107 --> 07:16.727
<b>At every turn, the Ashikaga are
giving orders to the Nitta.</b>

07:17.897 --> 07:19.277
<b>Lord Yoshisada.</b>

07:19.357 --> 07:22.947
<b>At this rate, it is as though you are
merely running errands for Takauji.</b>

07:23.027 --> 07:27.577
<b>Your achievement in taking Kamakura
surpasses Takauji's!</b>

07:28.197 --> 07:29.707
<b>Don't worry.</b>

07:29.787 --> 07:31.827
<b>If he turns against us,
we'll just defeat him!</b>

07:32.827 --> 07:34.127
<b>Let's eat!</b>

07:34.207 --> 07:36.877
<b>Thinking about the future
will not fill our stomachs!</b>

07:38.257 --> 07:39.717
<b>Our lord…</b>

07:40.337 --> 07:43.717
<b>Cuts down every arrow in a volley,</b>

07:43.797 --> 07:47.597
<b>and his bold command at Kamakura
will go down in history.</b>

07:47.677 --> 07:51.227
<b>Full of spirit and sharp-featured,
he is the very model of a warrior.</b>

07:52.017 --> 07:53.597
<b>But… you know?</b>

07:53.687 --> 07:54.767
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:54.857 --> 07:57.817
<b>You can see something beside his head
all the time, can't you?</b>

07:58.607 --> 07:59.647
<b>I wonder why.</b>

07:59.737 --> 08:05.117
<b>Somehow, I get the feeling
he has no idea what's going on.</b>

08:07.367 --> 08:08.367
<b>(7 P.M.)</b>

08:08.447 --> 08:10.947
<b>We will soon reach
Mr. Kusunoki's residence.</b>

08:11.037 --> 08:12.367
<b>Yes.</b>

08:12.457 --> 08:15.957
<b>That sly fox Kusunoki is dangerous,
if you ask me.</b>

08:16.537 --> 08:19.497
<b>He's way sharper than Nitta
but he hides it behind an innocent act.</b>

08:20.167 --> 08:22.547
<b>Don't be suspicious of others, Moroyasu.</b>

08:22.627 --> 08:25.587
<b>He is a trusted ally
serving the same Emperor.</b>

08:25.677 --> 08:28.467
<b>Thank you for your hard work
so late into the night.</b>

08:31.347 --> 08:32.727
<b>Mr. Kusunoki.</b>

08:33.517 --> 08:35.017
<b>You came out to meet us?</b>

08:35.897 --> 08:40.567
<b>Why did you come to greet us in person,
Mr. Kusunoki?</b>

08:40.647 --> 08:43.237
<b>I came to apologize for my oversight.</b>

08:43.317 --> 08:45.737
<b>The earlier guests have more attendants
than expected,</b>

08:45.817 --> 08:48.237
<b>and there is no room left for more horses.</b>

08:48.987 --> 08:52.117
<b>I managed to secure a place
for your horse, Mr. Takauji, but…</b>

08:52.747 --> 08:56.747
<b>Your retainers should follow them
to the horse tethering area over there.</b>

08:58.337 --> 08:59.747
<b>But in that case…</b>

08:59.837 --> 09:01.837
<b>My residence is just ahead.</b>

09:01.917 --> 09:05.427
<b>I will personally see to your protection,
Mr. Takauji.</b>

09:05.507 --> 09:08.097
<b>Hey, you! You are greatly underestimating
the Ashikaga Party.</b>

09:08.177 --> 09:09.637
<b>Enough, Moroyasu.</b>

09:10.967 --> 09:13.477
<b>We are the ones at fault
for arriving late to the banquet.</b>

09:13.557 --> 09:15.477
<b>Let us go, Mr. Kusunoki.</b>

09:15.557 --> 09:17.347
<b>Much obliged. Well then.</b>

09:20.897 --> 09:23.607
<b>Kusunoki is more of a fool than I thought.</b>

09:23.687 --> 09:26.737
<b>He is probably not accustomed
to hosting large banquets.</b>

09:27.447 --> 09:30.487
<b>After all, he is merely
an upstart of dubious origins.</b>

09:41.037 --> 09:43.087
<b>Hey, how much farther are we going?</b>

09:43.707 --> 09:46.877
<b>This is quite a long way to go
just to tether the horses.</b>

09:46.967 --> 09:47.967
<b>Huh?</b>

09:48.467 --> 09:51.467
<b>Lord Kusunoki told us that
once we got around here,</b>

09:51.557 --> 09:54.017
<b>Mr. Moronao would know
where to tether the horses.</b>

10:00.017 --> 10:01.147
<b>Well, then.</b>

10:01.227 --> 10:04.607
<b>What do you intend to do now?
Mr. Kusunoki, the impostor.</b>

10:06.357 --> 10:08.407
<b>You there, hiding behind that pine tree!</b>

10:08.987 --> 10:10.867
<b>You cannot take aim at me
unless you come out.</b>

10:20.127 --> 10:22.787
<b>Takauji Ashikaga, offer up your life!</b>

10:27.007 --> 10:28.257
<b>-<i>Got you!
-<i>Got you!</i></i></b>

10:30.967 --> 10:32.467
<b>Whoa there.</b>

10:41.807 --> 10:42.857
<b>He disappeared?</b>

10:43.767 --> 10:45.317
<b>Are you the leader?</b>

10:46.937 --> 10:48.397
<b><i>No! My face!</i></b>

10:48.487 --> 10:52.027
<b>I suppose you're the child of a warrior
who perished around Kyo.</b>

10:52.777 --> 10:56.287
<b>No wonder you were left
with nowhere to go and came to resent me.</b>

10:56.947 --> 10:59.407
<b>But do not throw your life away.</b>

11:00.287 --> 11:01.747
<b>Judging by your face…</b>

11:03.287 --> 11:05.207
<b>You look about ten, if that.</b>

11:06.127 --> 11:07.587
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

11:07.667 --> 11:09.547
<b>There are many enjoyable things.</b>

11:10.337 --> 11:13.637
<b>Forget your resentment for a while
and learn about the world.</b>

11:14.847 --> 11:17.637
<b>Someday, when you come to know
great joy in life,</b>

11:17.717 --> 11:20.637
<b>that look of resentment should disappear
from your face!</b>

11:21.847 --> 11:22.977
<b>Huh?</b>

11:24.307 --> 11:25.517
<b>Huh?</b>

11:26.817 --> 11:30.567
<b>You don't remember my face?</b>

11:31.107 --> 11:33.367
<b>Have we met before?</b>

11:34.907 --> 11:35.947
<b>My apologies.</b>

11:36.577 --> 11:40.367
<b>I quickly forget the faces of people
with whom I have little connection.</b>

11:40.457 --> 11:42.327
<b>You forget?</b>

11:43.247 --> 11:46.087
<b>I only want to think of what lies ahead.</b>

11:46.167 --> 11:50.127
<b>I leave it to my retainers
to remember what has already passed.</b>

11:51.217 --> 11:54.547
<b>No, truly, I'm sorry! I mean no ill will.</b>

11:55.257 --> 11:58.597
<b><i>This voice, this face, this touch.</i></b>

11:59.177 --> 12:00.977
<b><i>I remember all of it.</i></b>

12:01.977 --> 12:04.267
<b><i>And yet, this man…</i></b>

12:05.727 --> 12:07.437
<b>-Huh?
-Why?</b>

12:07.517 --> 12:10.237
<b>Why did you have to destroy Kamakura?</b>

12:10.987 --> 12:12.357
<b>Why?</b>

12:12.447 --> 12:14.277
<b>I don't really know myself.</b>

12:14.357 --> 12:17.077
<b>All I can say is that, in the end,
it had fallen.</b>

12:24.207 --> 12:25.957
<b><i>Is he saying</i></b>

12:26.667 --> 12:28.837
<b><i>he destroyed it
without even really knowing why?</i></b>

12:32.757 --> 12:34.297
<b>Oh, yes, child.</b>

12:34.967 --> 12:39.057
<b>Can you compose poetry?
Can you play the flute? Can you dance?</b>

12:40.967 --> 12:42.677
<b>What is this, all of a sudden?</b>

12:42.767 --> 12:46.607
<b>If you serve as my favored page,
I will take care of you.</b>

12:47.267 --> 12:49.267
<b>If you live prosperously in my service,</b>

12:49.357 --> 12:51.187
<b>your dead family would be pleased,
would they not?</b>

12:51.897 --> 12:53.777
<b>Yes, that would be good.</b>

12:54.277 --> 12:57.947
<b>There are plenty of fine clothes
and delicious sweets.</b>

13:00.407 --> 13:02.447
<b>Insolent wretch!</b>

13:02.537 --> 13:04.327
<b>But I see.</b>

13:05.617 --> 13:06.827
<b>Then I owe you an apology.</b>

13:07.327 --> 13:09.797
<b>If you have come here to kill me,</b>

13:10.377 --> 13:12.417
<b>then I suppose I must kill you.</b>

13:26.017 --> 13:27.147
<b>My lord!</b>

13:27.727 --> 13:30.357
<b><i>I didn't think
he was this much of a monster.</i></b>

13:30.937 --> 13:32.437
<b><i>Utter evil without even realizing it!</i></b>

13:32.527 --> 13:35.737
<b><i>A man who drives people mad and causes
their deaths simply by living innocently!</i></b>

13:36.567 --> 13:37.947
<b><i>I must save my lord!</i></b>

13:44.657 --> 13:45.827
<b>Fubuki!</b>

13:49.287 --> 13:50.667
<b>No! We can't beat him!</b>

13:50.747 --> 13:52.837
<b>Just as planned, don't push it!
We're getting out of here!</b>

14:03.927 --> 14:05.727
<b>He… He's fast!</b>

14:06.307 --> 14:09.347
<b><i>He's going to catch up to us.
If he catches us, we'll die!</i></b>

14:15.897 --> 14:18.697
<b>Where are you going, Mr. Takauji?</b>

14:18.777 --> 14:21.697
<b>The food for you will go cold.</b>

14:23.737 --> 14:25.947
<b>Mr. Kusunoki, why are you here?</b>

14:26.537 --> 14:29.367
<b>You were late arriving,
so I came out to meet you.</b>

14:29.957 --> 14:31.667
<b>My wife kept insisting,</b>

14:31.747 --> 14:35.877
<b>"It would be rude not to serve Mr. Takauji
his food piping hot!"</b>

14:35.957 --> 14:39.507
<b>If I don't take you right away,
she will scold me again.</b>

14:40.007 --> 14:42.887
<b>Please help me preserve my standing
in my own household!</b>

14:46.477 --> 14:48.767
<b>It seems you are the real one this time.</b>

14:49.937 --> 14:53.067
<b>I'm hungry now.
Let us enjoy your wife's cooking.</b>

14:55.937 --> 14:59.147
<b><i>I worried the boy might
have overheard that conversation,</i></b>

14:59.657 --> 15:01.567
<b><i>so I came to see what was happening.</i></b>

15:04.407 --> 15:07.787
<b><i>I will help you only this once, boy.</i></b>

15:11.037 --> 15:14.287
<b><i>I owe my present position to the Emperor.</i></b>

15:15.207 --> 15:17.757
<b><i>If you become an enemy of the Emperor,
whom I owe so much,</i></b>

15:17.837 --> 15:21.127
<b><i>then child or hero, I must defeat you.</i></b>

15:26.637 --> 15:28.347
<b>My lord! Are you unharmed?</b>

15:28.427 --> 15:29.767
<b>I am fine.</b>

15:29.847 --> 15:32.477
<b>What about those children who ran off?</b>

15:32.557 --> 15:33.857
<b>They were assassins.</b>

15:33.937 --> 15:37.067
<b>Their methods were remarkably cunning
for children.</b>

15:37.147 --> 15:40.147
<b>What? We must send men after them at once.</b>

15:40.237 --> 15:42.907
<b>No, that will not be necessary.
It is in the past.</b>

15:43.487 --> 15:46.867
<b>Rather than sending pursuers,
I would rather have sake and food.</b>

15:46.947 --> 15:50.117
<b>You truly are fearless, Mr. Takauji.</b>

15:50.207 --> 15:53.077
<b>Even talk of assassins
is just something to drink over.</b>

15:53.667 --> 15:54.877
<b><i>That sly fox.</i></b>

15:54.957 --> 15:56.837
<b><i>You're behind this, aren't you?</i></b>

15:56.917 --> 16:00.877
<b><i>This man, loyal to the Emperor,
is extremely troublesome.</i></b>

16:01.627 --> 16:03.587
<b><i>Eventually, he must be eliminated.</i></b>

16:04.177 --> 16:07.137
<b>By the way, what is on the menu today?</b>

16:07.217 --> 16:10.517
<b>We have your favorite udon, Mr. Takauji.</b>

16:10.597 --> 16:11.977
<b>Yes!</b>

16:12.057 --> 16:15.227
<b>Udon is a specialty
of our Shimotsuke province.</b>

16:15.727 --> 16:19.317
<b>I wonder whether there is anyone in Kyo
who can make udon better than I can.</b>

16:21.107 --> 16:22.817
<b>Don't make this a competition, Moronao.</b>

16:24.487 --> 16:26.067
<b>Sir Saionji!</b>

16:26.157 --> 16:29.197
<b>You are under arrest on suspicion
of plotting to assassinate the Emperor!</b>

16:30.197 --> 16:31.957
<b>SAIONJI VILLA (7 P.M.)</b>

16:34.327 --> 16:37.037
<b><i>It was not the Emperor
who came to the banquet,</i></b>

16:37.127 --> 16:38.667
<b><i>but the force sent to capture him.</i></b>

16:39.497 --> 16:43.337
<b><i>Yasuie Hojo and Kinmune Saionji's plot to
assassinate the Emperor ended in failure</i></b>

16:43.427 --> 16:47.427
<b><i>after Kinmune's younger brother informed
on them.</i></b>

16:47.507 --> 16:48.927
<b>OH CRAP</b>

16:49.007 --> 16:51.017
<b>So it has failed. This is the end of it!</b>

16:52.137 --> 16:53.727
<b>Let us flee, Sir Kinmune!</b>

16:56.607 --> 16:58.147
<b>I will not flee!</b>

16:59.527 --> 17:01.817
<b>Do not say that! Hurry!</b>

17:01.897 --> 17:05.237
<b>Everything is ready for your escape,
and we are fully prepared to hide you!</b>

17:05.317 --> 17:06.617
<b>Enough! Let go of me!</b>

17:07.197 --> 17:09.237
<b>I am of the illustrious Saionji clan.</b>

17:09.327 --> 17:11.577
<b>How could I place myself
in the care of barbarians?</b>

17:17.077 --> 17:19.037
<b>I lost the wager.</b>

17:19.587 --> 17:20.997
<b>One must pay the price of a lost wager,</b>

17:21.087 --> 17:23.337
<b>whether highborn or lowborn.</b>

17:25.297 --> 17:28.927
<b>I thank you
for helping me pursue my ambition, Yasuie.</b>

17:29.807 --> 17:34.727
<b>You should continue
fighting your barbaric war as a warrior.</b>

17:38.557 --> 17:41.107
<b><i>Farewell, Sir Saionji!</i></b>

17:49.277 --> 17:50.617
<b>Sir Saionji.</b>

17:50.697 --> 17:51.947
<b>It seems you are prepared.</b>

17:52.037 --> 17:53.697
<b>ADVISORS TO EMPEROR GODAIGO
CHIKAMITSU YUKI - NAGATOSHI NAWA</b>

17:58.417 --> 18:02.087
<b>Nawa, Yuki, Chigusa, Kusunoki…</b>

18:02.707 --> 18:06.127
<b>Upstarts of such obscure origins that
one scarcely knows where they came from.</b>

18:07.427 --> 18:11.717
<b>Your glory, dependent as it is
on the Emperor, will not last long.</b>

18:19.937 --> 18:21.897
<b><i>A golden temple, eh?</i></b>

18:22.517 --> 18:24.737
<b><i>I suppose I would have liked to see it.</i></b>

18:28.777 --> 18:32.027
<b><i>Kinmune Saionji was captured and executed.</i></b>

18:32.527 --> 18:34.657
<b><i>His lands were confiscated
by the imperial court.</i></b>

18:35.827 --> 18:39.667
<b><i>Years later, the Ashikaga clan purchased
the site of this plot,</i></b>

18:39.747 --> 18:42.997
<b><i>and Kinkakuji Temple was built there.</i></b>

18:45.257 --> 18:47.127
<b>(8 P.M.)</b>

18:55.767 --> 18:56.887
<b>Boy!</b>

18:59.807 --> 19:00.807
<b>Mima.</b>

19:01.977 --> 19:03.227
<b>Are you leaving already?</b>

19:04.147 --> 19:06.437
<b>I'm sorry
I cannot even say a proper goodbye.</b>

19:07.277 --> 19:10.157
<b>I truly enjoyed my time in Kyo with you.</b>

19:14.117 --> 19:16.497
<b>Hey. We'll see each other again, right?</b>

19:22.377 --> 19:23.587
<b>Someday, we will.</b>

19:34.257 --> 19:37.677
<b><i>I'm frustrated. I'm frustrated.
I'm frustrated!</i></b>

19:38.307 --> 19:41.187
<b><i>I was made
to endure humiliation after humiliation.</i></b>

19:41.767 --> 19:43.187
<b><i>And I could do nothing.</i></b>

19:44.397 --> 19:46.067
<b><i>I want to defeat that man.</i></b>

19:46.857 --> 19:48.857
<b><i>I want to become stronger!</i></b>

19:55.947 --> 19:58.827
<b>I never want to go near him again.</b>

19:59.657 --> 20:01.037
<b>That was my mistake.</b>

20:01.957 --> 20:04.077
<b>I never imagined
Takauji would be that formidable.</b>

20:05.957 --> 20:08.297
<b>Don't get so down, Fubuki!</b>

20:09.297 --> 20:13.007
<b>This attempt on Takauji's life
will throw Kyo into even greater turmoil.</b>

20:13.757 --> 20:17.637
<b>Your plan worked the moment
we carried it out!</b>

20:19.517 --> 20:21.977
<b>At our age, we were bound to lose.</b>

20:22.597 --> 20:25.857
<b>But if one loss scares us off,
we're no warriors!</b>

20:25.937 --> 20:29.647
<b>Someday, I'll definitely present his head
to my lord!</b>

20:31.397 --> 20:32.487
<b><i>Kojiro…</i></b>

20:33.157 --> 20:37.327
<b><i>It's when we're losing that
I'm most glad to have you with me.</i></b>

20:37.407 --> 20:38.617
<b>Let's load the baggage.</b>

20:38.697 --> 20:40.617
<b>Hey!</b>

20:42.327 --> 20:47.627
<b><i>We safely reunited with Uncle
and began our escape toward Shinano.</i></b>

20:49.087 --> 20:50.337
<b>Aw, man.</b>

20:50.417 --> 20:53.877
<b>I wanted to keep having fun in Kyo.
If only Takauji weren't around.</b>

20:54.587 --> 20:57.507
<b>Mima had such a lovely scent,
unlike anything I'd ever smelled before.</b>

20:58.097 --> 21:00.307
<b>I wish I'd asked
what kind of incense it was.</b>

21:00.807 --> 21:02.847
<b>It was so dazzling,
with everything you could want.</b>

21:03.387 --> 21:05.517
<b>Kyo was fun, wasn't it?</b>

21:09.607 --> 21:11.027
<b><i>Joy,</i></b>

21:11.107 --> 21:12.357
<b><i>frustration,</i></b>

21:12.987 --> 21:15.407
<b><i>and countless other things…
I learned so much.</i></b>

21:16.367 --> 21:19.537
<b><i>I will never forget
what happened in this city.</i></b>

21:32.547 --> 21:33.877
<b>I have returned.</b>

21:41.387 --> 21:43.307
<b>You have experienced much in Kyo.</b>

21:43.847 --> 21:47.267
<b>And now you look like a warrior
filled with fighting spirit.</b>

21:50.607 --> 21:53.187
<b>While you were away,
our troops were fully prepared.</b>

21:53.897 --> 21:55.897
<b>First, let us begin our strategy meeting
at once.</b>

21:57.907 --> 21:59.237
<b>The time has come.</b>

22:00.737 --> 22:03.367
<b>Let us begin the battle
to reclaim the realm.</b>

23:38.967 --> 23:39.837
<b>EPISODE 23 (1335): MY BUDDHA, PART TWO</b>

23:38.967 --> 23:39.837
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
